                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This would be a very weak \"Well, it's completely competent\" yes, if it weren't for the fact that the game is not just bland, but has a real weak bug (ie, every time you hit the default select key on a controller to go to the next stage, it chews a bomb).\n\nIt's utterly charmless, every non-boss enemy sprite is in stage 1, patterns never really do much, and the music is Baby's First Casio. This is the most paint by numbers bullet hell you could possibly try. Just skip it.",
